{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the cute world of Puzzle Crossing, a hybrid RPG Puzzle Adventure! Play Match-3 puzzles while casually helping your friends and townspeople. Collect and craft items, level up your abilities and use them to overcome new puzzle challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Explore</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the overworld to meet new friends, find hidden items and discover new locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544680/extras/02b724026831503d785630cfd5fc9a25.avif?t=1746209885\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544680/extras_big/02b724026831503d785630cfd5fc9a25.avif?t=1746209885 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Puzzle</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play fun match-3 puzzles and use your abilities and items to help you beat tougher challenges. With 12 upgradeable abilities and dozens of items you can choose your path to success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544680/extras/f0c34ee6374c7173a176d117c3626f7b.avif?t=1746209885\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544680/extras_big/f0c34ee6374c7173a176d117c3626f7b.avif?t=1746209885 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Quest</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help solve the mystery of Springbank while also taking on other quests to help your friends and other NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544680/extras/343605ecd2a487f2609701d0a1eb2154.avif?t=1746209885\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544680/extras_big/343605ecd2a487f2609701d0a1eb2154.avif?t=1746209885 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544680?t=1746209885","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544680?t=1746209885","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544680/40eb563c96b91420c375f275dbf31ec3e42111f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746209885","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544680/40eb563c96b91420c375f275dbf31ec3e42111f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746209885","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the cute world of Puzzle Crossing, a hybrid RPG Puzzle Adventure! Play Match-3 puzzles while casually helping your friends and townspeople. Collect and craft items, level up your abilities and use them to overcome new puzzle challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Explore</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the overworld to meet new friends, find hidden items and discover new locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544680/extras/02b724026831503d785630cfd5fc9a25.avif?t=1746209885\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544680/extras_big/02b724026831503d785630cfd5fc9a25.avif?t=1746209885 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Puzzle</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap